# Exact downstream request bytes, in order (step dividers)

### step 1: GET http://127.0.0.1:8397/v0/management/logs (logs disabled: GET -> 400)
GET /v0/management/logs HTTP/1.1
Host: 127.0.0.1:8397
User-Agent: curl/8.7.1
Accept: */*
Authorization: Bearer oracle-mgmt-key-1




### step 2: DELETE http://127.0.0.1:8397/v0/management/logs (logs disabled: DELETE -> 400)
DELETE /v0/management/logs HTTP/1.1
Host: 127.0.0.1:8397
User-Agent: curl/8.7.1
Accept: */*
Authorization: Bearer oracle-mgmt-key-1




### step 3: PUT http://127.0.0.1:8397/v0/management/logs-max-total-size-mb (set logs-max-total-size-mb)
