Content-Length: 11


{"value":5}

### step 4: GET http://127.0.0.1:8397/v0/management/logs-max-total-size-mb (read back)
GET /v0/management/logs-max-total-size-mb HTTP/1.1
Host: 127.0.0.1:8397
User-Agent: curl/8.7.1
Accept: */*
Authorization: Bearer oracle-mgmt-key-1




